Local modifications to third-party grammar files
- PlSqlParser.g4, rule `regular_id`: added the `FILE_EXT` token as an alternative, because upstream lexes the
  identifiers FNC/PKB/PKS/PRC/TRG/VW as file extensions and then fails to parse e.g. `create trigger trg ...`
  or a variable named `vw`. Marked with "LOCAL PATCH" in the grammar.
- PlSqlParserBase.java / PlSqlLexerBase.java: adapted for this project (statement-terminator handling after PL/SQL units).
